# Refactor trigger

If code smells like legacy JavaFX inside a JRebirth app:
- identify the missing JRebirth role split
- move state into Model
- move node creation into View
- move event wiring into Controller
- move actions into Command or Service
- move cross-feature messaging into Waves

Use the legacy refactor skill before editing many files.
